{"diagnosis": "Fetch test executes NOP (ADDI x0,0, funct3 000) but traps with FAIL 0xdead and TRAP: cpu trap asserted instead of progressing. instr_addi at picorv32.v:1057 uses != 3'b000 so ADDI never decodes while other ALU-imm opcodes falsely assert ADDI. The resulting illegal-instruction decode causes the observed trap.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1057,1 +1057,1 @@
-			instr_addi  <= is_alu_reg_imm && mem_rdata_q[14:12] != 3'b000;
+			instr_addi  <= is_alu_reg_imm && mem_rdata_q[14:12] == 3'b000;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no TRAP: cpu trap asserted"}

